@startuml
title Lumen - Modelo de datos persistido localmente

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

rectangle "Product\n---\nid\nslug\ndisplayName\ndescription\nprice\ncompareAtPrice\nstock\ncategory\nstatus\ncreatedAt\nupdatedAt\nname\nmaterial\ncolor\nimage\nbadge" as Product

rectangle "ProductImage\n---\nurl\nalt\nposition\ncolor" as ProductImage

rectangle "CartItem\n---\nid\nproductId\nslug\nname\nvariant\nunitPrice\nprice\nquantity\nimage\ncolor\nsize" as CartItem

rectangle "Cart\n---\nitems\nsubtotal\ntax\ntotal\nupdatedAt" as Cart

rectangle "Order\n---\nid\nstatus\nsubtotal\ntax\ndiscountTotal\ndiscountCode\ntotal\ncustomerEmail\ncustomerName\npaymentMethod\ncreatedAt\nupdatedAt" as Order

rectangle "ShippingAddress\n---\naddress\napartment\ncity\nzip\nphone" as ShippingAddress

rectangle "Discount\n---\nid\ncode\ntype\nvalue\nstatus\nstartsAt\nendsAt\ncreatedAt\nupdatedAt" as Discount

rectangle "StoreSettings\n---\nid\nstoreName\ncurrency\ntaxRate\nlocale\nupdatedAt" as StoreSettings

rectangle "IndexedDB\nlumens-commerce" as IndexedDB
rectangle "sessionStorage\nadmin session + checkout draft" as SessionStorage
rectangle "localStorage\nadmin email + password" as LocalStorage

Product --> ProductImage : images
Product --> CartItem : selected as item
Cart --> CartItem : aggregates
Order --> CartItem : stores items
Order --> ShippingAddress : shippingAddress
Order ..> Discount : optional code

IndexedDB .. Product
IndexedDB .. CartItem
IndexedDB .. Order
IndexedDB .. Discount
IndexedDB .. StoreSettings

note right of Cart
Cart es un resumen calculado a partir
de los CartItem persistidos en IndexedDB.
No existe como store independiente.
end note

note right of SessionStorage
Guarda la sesion administrativa local
y el borrador temporal del checkout.
end note

note right of LocalStorage
Guarda las credenciales administrativas
configuradas en el navegador actual.
end note

note bottom of IndexedDB
El proyecto no usa una base SQL tradicional.
La persistencia principal vive en APIs del navegador.
end note

@enduml
